---
title: "initialize (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate ECIES publicKey, timing, addresses, fees
    q_validate_params --> q_validate_key: params non-zero
    q_validate_params --> q_revert: revert InvalidInitializationParams
    q_validate_key --> q_check_timing: ECIES publicKey point on curve
    q_validate_key --> q_revert: revert InvalidECIESPublicKey
    q_check_timing --> q_store_config: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert: revert InvalidTimingParams
    q_store_config --> q_store_key: store bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin, fees
    q_store_key --> q_store_timing: store ECIES publicKey (x, y)
    q_store_timing --> [*]: store startTime, endTime, refundEndTime, emit Initialized
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_validate_key
        INV-001: ECIES public key must be a valid point on the elliptic curve
        INV-002: public key coordinates (x, y) must be non-zero
    end note

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-003: startTime < endTime (active period 1h to 12 weeks)
        INV-004: endTime < refundEndTime (refund period 1h to 2 weeks)
        INV-005: minimumInvestAmount must be greater than zero
    end note
